        "original_id": "2e3be056-5187-53af-83e5-6f8475cfe4d2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Neringa Municipality, Klaipėda County, Lithuania, Curonian Spit, Pervalka\n- Organizations: Municipalities of Lithuania, elderships\n- Concepts: administrative divisions\n\nFacts:\n- Lithuania is divided into 60 municipalities, called savivaldybės in Lithuanian.\n- Lithuania’s municipalities are further divided into more than 500 elderships, called seniūnijos in Lithuanian.\n- Neringa Municipality, also called Neringa or Neringos savivaldybė in Lithuanian, is a municipality in Klaipėda County in the westernmost part of Lithuania.\n- Neringa Municipality comprises several villages on the Curonian Spit.\n- Pervalka is administratively part of the city of Neringa.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
